 <name>FSM</name>
 <channel>pear.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Finite State Machine</summary>
 <description>The FSM package provides a simple class that implements a Finite State Machine.

In addition to maintaining state, this FSM also maintains a user-defined payload, therefore effectively making the machine a Pushdown Automaton (a finite state machine with memory).</description>
